<p><strong>SCP-4475:</strong> So Long, and Thanks for All the Milk<br />
<strong>Authors:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572476377" alt="FloppyPhoenix" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;">FloppyPhoenix</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kindlyturtleclem" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4504036); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4504036&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572476377" alt="KindlyTurtleClem" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4504036)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kindlyturtleclem" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4504036); return false;">KindlyTurtleClem</a></span></p>
<p>This article is <strong>FIRE TURTLE (Clem and Floppy)</strong>'s 2nd article for the <strong>2019 Collaboration Contest</strong>! The two primary Groups of Interest featured are <strong>Fifthism</strong> and <strong>Church of the Second Hytoth</strong>.</p>
<p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/land-of-honey" target="_blank">Go here for the first entry!</a></strong></p>
