<p>HOLY POOP. I must've been severely tired when we were making the finalizing touches because I didn't get a chance to tell you lot how wonderful and creative Floppy was in all this. Annnnd its October. Dat early alzheimer's tho. I am horrible.</p>
<p>Honestly, working with her, chipping away at wee details to the end of the night, constantly keeping in conversation with her, and shooting the ole idea-ball back and forth with her&#8230; well&#8230; it was just a delight.</p>
<p>Thanks for giving our disgusting child your eyes, future readers!</p>
